    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "2.3.11【构造函数法之双根式】"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.119,
      0.248,
      0.134
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "▲适用题型：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.146,
      0.745,
      0.171
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "常用于单调性未知的根式型 \\( f(x) = \\sqrt{a(x - b)} + \\sqrt{c(d - x)} (ac > 0) \\) 求值域；",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.183,
      0.517,
      0.199
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "▲方法原理：构造一个满足三个条件的新函数：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.146,
      0.211,
      0.843,
      0.26
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "①与原函数定义域一致②在定义域上单调③且与原函数平方和为定常数，即可利用所构造函数的值域求出 \\( f(x) \\) 的值域.",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.276,
      0.234,
      0.291
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "怎么构造？",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.306,
      0.513,
      0.326
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "比如：求 \\(f(x) = \\sqrt{3x - 6} +\\sqrt{8 - 2x},x\\in [2,4]\\) 值域",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.344,
      0.848,
      0.393
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(1) 由于 \\( f(x) = \\sqrt{3(x - 2)} + \\sqrt{2(4 - x)} \\) 前后平方后出现 3 (x - 2) 和 2 (4 - x)，为了消去 \\( x \\)，我们需要新函数含有 -3x 和 2x；",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.406,
      0.744,
      0.422
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(2)为了保持与原函数定义域一致，我们再进行添项变成3（4-x）和2(x-2);",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.435,
      0.848,
      0.515
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "(3)考虑新函数单调性和与原函数平方和为定值，所以构造 \\(-\\sqrt{3(4 - x)} +\\sqrt{2(x - 2)}\\) ，从而得到 \\(\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l}h(x) = -\\sqrt{3(4 - x)} +\\sqrt{2(x - 2)}\\uparrow \\\\ -\\sqrt{6} = h(2)\\leq h(x)\\leq h(4) = 2 \\end{array} \\right.\\) ，且 \\(f^{2}(x) + h^{2}(x) = 10\\) ，最后",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "list",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.344,
      0.848,
      0.515
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": null
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "bbox": [
      0.15,
      0.526,
      0.501,
      0.57
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} h ^ {2} (x) \\in [ 0, 6 ] \\\\ f ^ {2} (x) = 1 0 - h ^ {2} (x) \\in [ 4, 1 0 ] \\end{array} \\Rightarrow f (x) \\in \\left[ 2, \\sqrt {1 0} \\right]; \\right.\n\\]"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.582,
      0.416,
      0.597
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "总结构造新函数技巧（快速构造）：",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "equation",
    "bbox": [
      0.15,
      0.614,
      0.667,
      0.667
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "\\[\n\\left\\{ \\begin{array}{l} f (x) = \\sqrt {a (x - b)} + \\sqrt {c (d - x)} \\Rightarrow h (x) = - \\sqrt {a (d - x)} + \\sqrt {c (x - b)} \\\\ (x - b) \\text {和} (d - x) \\text {交换位置}, \\sqrt {a (d - x)} \\text {前再添负号} \\end{array} \\right.\n\\]"
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.147,
      0.686,
      0.747,
      0.706
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "例题1.（上海·高一专题练习）函数 \\( f(x) = \\sqrt{2x - 1} + \\sqrt{2 - x} \\) 的值域为 ____.",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.752,
      0.721,
      0.771
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "习题1.（全国·高一专题练习） \\( f(x)=\\sqrt{x}+\\sqrt{4-2x} \\) 的最大值为____.",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
  {
    "type": "text",
    "bbox": [
      0.148,
      0.818,
      0.804,
      0.835
    ],
    "angle": 0,
    "content": "习题2.（全国·高三专题练习）若 \\( y = \\sqrt{x - 4} + \\sqrt{18 - 3x} \\)，则 \\( y \\) 的取值范围是 ____",
    "merge_prev": false
  },
